{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Collection Item","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404024","type":"Type"}],"id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/library/7653","identified_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"repository number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404621"}],"content":"7653","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"call number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300311706"}],"content":"JC257 .S5 1944a","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"preferred term","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404670"}],"content":"Everybody's political what's what  ","type":"Name"}],"produced_by":{"carried_out_by":[{"_label":"Shaw, Bernard,","id":"actor/shaw-bernard","type":"Actor"},{"_label":"Dodd, Mead","id":"actor/dodd-mead","type":"Actor"}],"timespan":{"_label":"1944","begin_of_the_begin":"1944-01-01T00:00:00Z","end_of_the_end":"1944-01-01T00:00:00Z","type":"TimeSpan"},"type":"Production"},"referred_to_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"inscription statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435414"}],"content":"grl copy : good condition ; dust jacket : good condition.|Inscription on front loose endpaper from [Dorothy Newman?] to Alfred Stieglitz, January 5, 1945 : For A. S. / Ordered before January 1 - / arrived after January 1 - / But every day is / birthday, also every / day is the beginning / of a New Year - / Therefore this day is / the beginning of a / New Year - and / a birthday too. / And this day, like / every day is special / and brings special / D. / January 5 - 1945.","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"From Georgia O'Keeffe's Ghost Ranch library.\nIncludes index.","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}